<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>out of the sea,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἰχθύς</span>”
				<i>leaping out of the sea,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					117
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τὸ σκάφος ἀνασπᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἀΐσσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.593
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγὴ ἔ.</span> a blow on a
			ship's hull <i>above water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.3.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ. τῆς νεώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>JTr.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			; <i>rising high out of the water,</i> of islands, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.1.52
			</span></i>.</div>
